    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/b32d856d8612593a6ab039913af1844b.poster.avif?t=1750421585\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/b32d856d8612593a6ab039913af1844b.webm?t=1750421585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/b32d856d8612593a6ab039913af1844b.mp4?t=1750421585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Custom Party, the free indie online party game based on customization !</strong><br><br>Custom Party is a <strong>party game for 2 to 8 players</strong> <strong>online</strong>.<br>It contains a <strong>unique customization system</strong> and <strong>lots of mini-games</strong> to play !<br><br><strong>Which makes this game a great experience to play with friends or even in competition!</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/d8667603712f87500480f2d0a6c2aef4.poster.avif?t=1750421585\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/d8667603712f87500480f2d0a6c2aef4.webm?t=1750421585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/d8667603712f87500480f2d0a6c2aef4.mp4?t=1750421585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>All elements of customization for your character are essential ! </strong><br><br>Choose your <strong>hats, shoes, tops, and colors</strong> wisely! All items affect <strong>your playstyle</strong> by <strong>changing stats</strong> or even <strong>powers</strong> !<br><strong>Combined with the fact that it is a multiplayer game, this gives each playthrough a unique experience !</strong><br><br><i>All hats, tops, bottoms and colors will not be paid for, all items are completely free.</i><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/ed7724cfea7c5647b86990587c73a6fd.poster.avif?t=1750421585\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/ed7724cfea7c5647b86990587c73a6fd.webm?t=1750421585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/ed7724cfea7c5647b86990587c73a6fd.mp4?t=1750421585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>We are introducing an innovative new ranking system called \u00ab Take A Risk !\u00a0\u00bb !</strong><br><br>It works by choosing a number of <strong>Ranking Points</strong> that you must stake in each game you play !<br>So this gives players who feel underranked <strong>a chance to face</strong> higher ranked players by <strong>taking a risk</strong> !<br><br>Additionally, it encourages cautious players to bet less, and slowly but surely progress to <strong>new ranks</strong> !<br><br><strong>Everyone can play however they want !</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/b32d856d8612593a6ab039913af1844b.poster.avif?t=1750421585\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/b32d856d8612593a6ab039913af1844b.webm?t=1750421585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/b32d856d8612593a6ab039913af1844b.mp4?t=1750421585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Custom Party, the free indie online party game based on customization !</strong><br><br>Custom Party is a <strong>party game for 2 to 8 players</strong> <strong>online</strong>.<br>It contains a <strong>unique customization system</strong> and <strong>lots of mini-games</strong> to play !<br><br><strong>Which makes this game a great experience to play with friends or even in competition!</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/d8667603712f87500480f2d0a6c2aef4.poster.avif?t=1750421585\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/d8667603712f87500480f2d0a6c2aef4.webm?t=1750421585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/d8667603712f87500480f2d0a6c2aef4.mp4?t=1750421585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>All elements of customization for your character are essential ! </strong><br><br>Choose your <strong>hats, shoes, tops, and colors</strong> wisely! All items affect <strong>your playstyle</strong> by <strong>changing stats</strong> or even <strong>powers</strong> !<br><strong>Combined with the fact that it is a multiplayer game, this gives each playthrough a unique experience !</strong><br><br><i>All hats, tops, bottoms and colors will not be paid for, all items are completely free.</i><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/ed7724cfea7c5647b86990587c73a6fd.poster.avif?t=1750421585\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/ed7724cfea7c5647b86990587c73a6fd.webm?t=1750421585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904730/extras/ed7724cfea7c5647b86990587c73a6fd.mp4?t=1750421585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>We are introducing an innovative new ranking system called \u00ab Take A Risk !\u00a0\u00bb !</strong><br><br>It works by choosing a number of <strong>Ranking Points</strong> that you must stake in each game you play !<br>So this gives players who feel underranked <strong>a chance to face</strong> higher ranked players by <strong>taking a risk</strong> !<br><br>Additionally, it encourages cautious players to bet less, and slowly but surely progress to <strong>new ranks</strong> !<br><br><strong>Everyone can play however they want !</strong>",
    "short_description": "Custom Party is a free indie party-game. Players can use different powers (dash, explosion...) and have different stats based on their character customization. It introduces an innovative ranking system named \u00abTake a Risk\u00bb. The game allows everybody to play in the playstyle they want.",
